Source: vortex-archive-keyring
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Vortex OS <khemchanseenanan@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: vortex-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: GnuPG archive keyring and apt source for the Vortex OS repository
 Ships the public GPG key used to sign the Vortex OS apt repository and a
 deb822 sources entry pinned to that key, so a machine trusts exactly one
 additional archive: the Vortex repo.
